Collect etcd logs with Fluentd.

etcd is configured with ETCD_LOGGER "zap" and logs to
/var/log/kolla/etcd/etcd.log, but nothing tails that file, so etcd is
the one deployed service whose logs never reach the central log store.
etcd 3.5 has no --log-format flag -- zap is the only logger, and
structured JSON is the only thing it emits -- so collecting etcd means
parsing JSON.

Prompt: while deciding how to handle Kerbside's JSON logs we discovered
that etcd has the same concerns and has been exempted from fluentd log
collection. We then built this on top of the Kerbside changes to
demonstrate that the JSON parser generalises.

